  "details": "The chatbox no longer follows the player when the player is moved by a world using teleportation (as well as stations, but this seems like a separate issue due to behaving slightly differently. See notes for more information).\n\n# Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Visit a world that teleports the player.\n\n2. Open the chatbox while being teleported.\n\n# Observed result\n\nThe chatbox input field is locked to the position it is spawned in relative to the world, not the player.\n\n# Notes\n\n- See attachments for more information.\n\n- This issue occurs both in VR and desktop mode\n\n- Teleporting can be tested in Super VR Ball https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_ff8b4a6e-4268-4783-bc16-3103067a4be6/info\n\n- A similar issue also newly occurs (only in VR) when in moving stations, except only with the keyboard. It appears to lag behind the input field significantly when in a moving station.\n\n- Stations can be tested in Test Pilots https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_e4908cea-023b-4749-9ad7-a898\n\n- This issue does not occur when moved by momentum, such as opening the chatbox while falling or being launched.",
